---
import Title from "@components/global/Title.astro";
---

<section>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8 py-12 md:px-12 lg:px-32 lg:py-32">
		<div>
			<Title title="Terms" subtitle="Last updated January 1, 2025" class="pb-10 pt-20 uppercase" />
		</div>
		<div class="prose-styles mt-12 lg:mt-24">
			<h2 id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-toki-labs-services">
				All the terms that you agree to when you engage Toki Labs for software development services.
			</h2>

			<p>
				From everyone at Toki Labs, thank you for considering us as your software development partner! We build solutions to help you solve your most complex technical challenges. As a software house that works differently, we believe in partnership over traditional client relationships.
			</p>
			<p>
				When we say "Company", "we", "our", or "us" in this document, we are referring to Toki Labs, a software development company specializing in complex system architecture, technical leadership, and innovative software solutions.
			</p>
			<p>
				When we say "Services", we mean our consulting and development services, including but not limited to: software architecture design, system migration, team building and mentorship, technical leadership consulting, and custom software development.
			</p>
			<p>
				When we say "You", "your", or "Partner", we are referring to the individuals or organizations that engage our services. Our approach is built on partnership - we seek and support partners, not just clients.
			</p>

			<p>
				<strong>Partnership Approach:</strong> We believe in discovering the right solution together through our consulting + execution methodology. This means we may recommend alternatives to your initial request if we identify more effective approaches to solve your actual business problems.
			</p>

			<p>Terms of Service content is currently being finalized. For specific questions about our partnership terms and service agreements, please contact us at hello@tokilabs.io.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
